{% comment %}
  Purely decorative window controls. Real DOM elements with the authentic
  macOS red/yellow/green dots, but intentionally non-interactive: no hover
  or press feedback, nothing closes, minimizes, or navigates anything.
  aria-hidden and tabindex="-1" because there is nothing for assistive
  tech or keyboard users to act on.
{% endcomment %}
<div class="traffic-lights" aria-hidden="true">
  <button type="button" class="traffic-lights__button traffic-lights__button--close" tabindex="-1"></button>
  <button type="button" class="traffic-lights__button traffic-lights__button--minimize" tabindex="-1"></button>
  <button type="button" class="traffic-lights__button traffic-lights__button--zoom" tabindex="-1"></button>
</div>
